WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.142 --> 00:00:02.640
- I didn't sign up for demons, okay?

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.637
I signed up for ghosts.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.349
(wind and creaking)

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:09.247
- [Voiceover] My aunt sees dead people,

00:00:09.247 --> 00:00:13.156
so my aunt's not lying to
everyone in the family.

00:00:13.156 --> 00:00:14.479
She can't be lying to everyone.

00:00:14.479 --> 00:00:15.919
She has some cool stories, though.

00:00:15.919 --> 00:00:19.378
- I tried to contact my dead cat.

00:00:19.378 --> 00:00:22.002
The next day, I woke up, put on pants

00:00:22.002 --> 00:00:24.881
and there was cat hair on my pants.

00:00:24.881 --> 00:00:27.714
- Middle of the day,
I see this white flash

00:00:27.714 --> 00:00:29.153
of light go in front of me.

00:00:29.153 --> 00:00:31.081
- [Male] Is there anyone here?

00:00:31.081 --> 00:00:32.776
- [Female 1] It's doing something.

00:00:32.776 --> 00:00:35.237
Anybody else freaked out?

00:00:35.237 --> 00:00:38.341
- [Voiceover] Is there a good spirit?

00:00:38.597 --> 00:00:39.733
Y, yes.
- [Male] Y.

00:00:39.733 --> 00:00:40.718
- That's yes.
- [Female 1] Y. Yes. Okay.

00:00:40.718 --> 00:00:44.112
- [Female 2] Can you tell us your name?

00:00:44.642 --> 00:00:46.456
- (in unison) No.

00:00:46.456 --> 00:00:48.802
- [Female 1] Maybe it's an animal.

00:00:48.802 --> 00:00:50.240
- [Male] Oh my God.
- [Female 1] Are you...

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.004
- [Male] Are you an animal?

00:00:52.004 --> 00:00:55.084
Yes, I did talk to my cat once.

00:00:55.084 --> 00:00:56.663
- [Female 2] Y, yes.
- [Male] It's an animal.

00:00:56.663 --> 00:00:57.823
- [Male] We have to ask the animals

00:00:57.823 --> 00:00:59.406
questions they're used to hearing like

00:00:59.406 --> 00:01:00.143
- [Male] Are you a
- [Female 1] Do they want

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:02.364
- [Male] good boy?
- [Female 1] a treat?

00:01:02.584 --> 00:01:04.539
- [Female 1] Oh, boy.

00:01:04.539 --> 00:01:06.366
- [Male] Oh, no. It's mad, it's mad.

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.512
It wants bye.

00:01:07.512 --> 00:01:09.307
- [Female 2] A haunted goodbye.

00:01:09.307 --> 00:01:11.221
- I'm starting to get a little concerned

00:01:11.221 --> 00:01:12.707
about what I got myself into.

00:01:12.707 --> 00:01:14.100
- [Female 2] At first,
I thought it was you,

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.218
but then I noticed that
your fingers were also

00:01:16.218 --> 00:01:17.915
twitching and barely
- [Male] Shaking?

00:01:17.915 --> 00:01:19.668
touching it and so I was like
- [Male] Yeah, that's out

00:01:19.668 --> 00:01:21.212
"Ah, it's gotta be Jamie.
- [Male] of straight fear.

00:01:21.212 --> 00:01:24.022
- I really just wanted
to take my fingers off.

00:01:24.022 --> 00:01:25.206
- It was surreal.

00:01:25.206 --> 00:01:27.691
Is there anyone here?

00:01:27.691 --> 00:01:29.664
- [Female 1] Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:01:29.664 --> 00:01:32.009
Whoa, I'm not even touching this,

00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:33.751
how is this even possible?

00:01:33.751 --> 00:01:35.701
Seems like weird stuff is going on.

00:01:35.701 --> 00:01:38.929
- [Female 2] Whoever's
here, are you a good spirit?

00:01:38.929 --> 00:01:42.527
What's your name?

00:01:42.527 --> 00:01:45.842
- [Male] It's going to Z, is that bad?

00:01:45.842 --> 00:01:47.335
- [Female 1] Is that a U?
- Female 2] U.

00:01:47.335 --> 00:01:48.393
- (in unison) S.

00:01:48.393 --> 00:01:49.287
- [Female 2] Zus.

00:01:49.287 --> 00:01:51.292
- [Male] Zus, I told you it was Zus.

00:01:51.292 --> 00:01:52.522
- [Female 2] Zus, can you tell us

00:01:52.522 --> 00:01:53.513
what year you died?

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:54.844
- [Female 1] Six, six

00:01:54.844 --> 00:01:55.509
- [Female 2] Six.

00:01:55.509 --> 00:01:57.622
- [Female 1] nine-six.
- [Male] nine-six.

00:01:57.622 --> 00:02:01.326
- [Male] Did you die in 1996?

00:02:01.326 --> 00:02:02.776
1896?

00:02:02.776 --> 00:02:05.170
1796?

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:07.492
- [Female 1] Okay, we're
going to something.

00:02:07.492 --> 00:02:08.769
Y, must be yes.

00:02:08.769 --> 00:02:09.976
- [Male] That's yes.
- [Female 2] Y.

00:02:09.976 --> 00:02:11.648
- [Male] We still don't know if

00:02:11.648 --> 00:02:13.668
it's a good or a bad spirit?

00:02:13.668 --> 00:02:15.347
- [Female 2] Yeah, it never answered.

00:02:15.347 --> 00:02:17.367
- We'll regret this.

00:02:17.367 --> 00:02:18.179
- [Female 1] I don't think we should

00:02:18.179 --> 00:02:19.805
ask whether it's a bad spirit or not.

00:02:19.805 --> 00:02:21.151
- [Male] I would like to
know if it is a bad spirit.

00:02:21.151 --> 00:02:23.611
- [Female 1] I don't wanna
know, I don't wanna know.

00:02:23.611 --> 00:02:24.146
- [Male] Carol?
- [Female 2] Zus,

00:02:24.146 --> 00:02:27.077
are you a good spirit?

00:02:27.077 --> 00:02:29.765
- [Female 1] I don't wanna know.

00:02:29.765 --> 00:02:30.694
- [Male] No, no, no.

00:02:30.694 --> 00:02:32.440
No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:33.371
- [Female 1] No, no. Where are we going?

00:02:33.371 --> 00:02:35.182
- [Male] No, no, no. Night is bad.

00:02:35.182 --> 00:02:36.692
If everyone promises that

00:02:36.692 --> 00:02:39.153
they weren't pushing it.

00:02:39.153 --> 00:02:40.360
- [Female 2] I like pinky promise,

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.754
triple pinky promise.

00:02:41.754 --> 00:02:42.938
- [Male] Cool, then goodbye.

00:02:42.938 --> 00:02:44.617
(laughter)

00:02:44.617 --> 00:02:45.979
Absolutely not.

00:02:45.979 --> 00:02:47.790
- [Female 2] That did not just happen.

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:50.581
- [Male] The more I told myself

00:02:50.581 --> 00:02:52.230
it's not real, don't believe it,

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:53.832
that didn't really happen,

00:02:53.832 --> 00:02:55.550
it's like the more freaked out I got.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:56.295
- [Female 1] I don't even know how

00:02:56.295 --> 00:02:58.267
to explain what just happened

00:02:58.267 --> 00:03:00.287
which must mean something
about it is real.

00:03:00.287 --> 00:03:01.634
- [Female 2] I'm still scared.

00:03:01.634 --> 00:03:03.718
(ghostly noises)

